-- 0063_fda_register_0025_0038.sql
--
-- Fourteen registrations from the อย. licence listing supplied on 15/08/26 —
-- serials 0025 through 0038. The register already held 0001–0024.
--
-- One trap to avoid. RP0025 to RP0031 already exist in this table as products
-- awaiting registration with no serial number: ไส้กรอก, ลูกชิ้น and หมูทอด under
-- the หมูหอม Selection brand. Up to RP0024 the row id and the serial suffix
-- happened to match, so it would be natural to assume RP0025 holds serial 0025.
-- It does not. Serials 0025–0038 were issued to entirely different products.
-- The pending rows keep their null serial and are annotated so nobody makes
-- that assumption later; the new registrations get new ids.
--
-- Those pending rows matter for another reason: ไส้กรอก and ลูกชิ้น are the two
-- groups QM-QA-04 ข้อ 1 names as outside the approved hazard analysis.

